  "description": "YEXTOO crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C162 H124 Ho4 N12 O16,2(C2 H3 N1),C2 H6 O1. From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.538-3.839 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.66-111.54°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C168H136N14O17Ho4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
